#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:5
#: 151f0e70a09f42a5b4be838c0d51ae42
msgid "The Cube Yellow Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:12
#: a859ae51e4724ad78a4a42a4be5745e8
msgid "System Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:14
#: 2d76a4eec6084b7cb4bbcd9ebff4d220
msgid "The Cube Yellow autopilot is a new model in the CubePilot ecosystem, designed for hobby users, commercial system integrators and UAS manufacturers the Cube Yellow is based on the Arm STM32F7 series SOC. Sitting directly between the Cube Black and Orange this model offers better performance and newer sensors over the Cube Black while retaining F series SOC compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:16
#: 4dd97565466f49e6ba3b9d292b10d113
msgid "Just like the other models the Yellow is part of a wide ecosystem of autopilot modules and carrier boards. All the Cube models are compatible with all of the carriers which allows users to choose an off the shelf carrier board design that best suits their needs. System designers are able to integrate the Cube directly into their designs via published carrier board specifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:20
#: 6e621048b15b4864a41cdafa22792a48
msgid "Cube Yellow Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:22
#: b9a059638a024c9ea7e3e57f70202798
msgid "Faster F7 SOC with 512KB ram"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:23
#: 30121296855f405fa29de5ee9f39137e
msgid "Upgraded triple redundant IMU sensors for extra redundancy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:24
#: 0b028197d5c14d47a223beb7a2a65189
msgid "2 sets of IMU are vibration-isolated mechanically, reducing the effect of frame vibration to state estimation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:25
#: 33f3c8c4d38345c4ab0b148dddcc7909
msgid "IMUs are temperature-controlled by onboard heating resistors, allowing optimum working temperature of IMUs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:26
#: c3615960f3a44e39a123bddbf316b21e
msgid "The entire flight management unit(FMU) and inertial management unit(IMU) are housed in a reatively small form factor (a cube)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeyellow-overview.rst:27
#: dd604cecc19c472e81bd381eb2c17d1b
msgid "Fully CubePilot carrierboard compatible, all inputs and outputs go through a 80-pin DF17 connector, allowing a plug-in solution for manufacturers of commercial systems. Manufacturers can design their own carrier boards to suit their specific needs now and in the future."
msgstr ""

